{"id": "good-rural-numbers-that-change", "title": "The Good Rural: paid before it registered, and one year told four ways", "seconds": 132.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.12, "made": "2026-11-24", "key": "ed955c729c4f7f0a", "words": 408, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "The Good Rural, a small San Francisco nonprofit,", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 2.98, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ag", "kicker": "California Attorney General · charity registry", "text": "The Good Rural, registration CT0285838: first registered 12 May 2023", "mark": "12 May 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.32, 0.78, 0.91, 1.23, 1.4, 1.84]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[1]", "timeline[4]"], "text": "joined the State's charity registry on May 12, 2023.", "t0": 2.98, "t1": 6.16, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ag", "kicker": "California Attorney General · charity registry", "text": "The Good Rural, registration CT0285838: first registered 12 May 2023", "mark": "12 May 2023"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.31, 0.4, 0.72, 1.1, 1.55, 1.72, 1.91, 2.31, 2.63]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "By then, the City had paid it 301,636.78 dollars,", "t0": 6.28, "t1": 12.11, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-06-30", "to": "2023-05-12", "days": "", "fromLab": "fiscal 2022 closes: $301,636.78 paid", "toLab": "it registers with the State", "kicker": "The Good Rural"}, "emph": ["301,636.78"], "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.95, 1.11, 1.37, 1.5, 1.71, 1.82, 2.08, 2.45, 2.65, 3.1, 3.34, 3.6, 4.07, 4.44, 4.57, 5.06]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "span", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "timeline[2]"], "text": "in a fiscal year already closed.", "t0": 12.11, "t1": 13.77, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "span", "from": "2022-06-30", "to": "2023-05-12", "days": "", "fromLab": "fiscal 2022 closes: $301,636.78 paid", "toLab": "it registers with the State", "kicker": "The Good Rural"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.19, 0.28, 0.65, 0.84, 1.15]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["amount", "established[0]"], "text": "In all, the City paid it 1,678,032 dollars over four years.", "t0": 13.89, "t1": 17.51, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,678,032", "label": "paid by the City, fiscal 2022 to 2025", "sub": "Human Rights Commission and OEWD"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.18, 0.72, 0.88, 1.11, 1.28, 1.36, 1.59, 1.76, 1.96, 2.22, 2.49, 2.79, 3.0, 3.22]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "caveat", "ref": ["caveat", "notEstablished[0]"], "text": "This is a lead, not a finding. Nothing here shows City money was misspent.", "t0": 17.93, "t1": 22.0, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "caveat", "line": "This is a lead, not a finding: a pattern in public records. This film says what the records show, what they do not show, and what would settle it."}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.31, 0.4, 0.92, 1.08, 1.15, 2.05, 2.34, 2.53, 2.85, 3.09, 3.29, 3.47]}, {"scene": "reg", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]", "suspicious[0].what"], "text": "Its registry file holds a notice to register dated October 22, 2021.", "t0": 22.22, "t1": 26.49, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ag", "kicker": "Notice to register", "text": "dated 22 October 2021; the registry's document list dates it 7 March 2023", "mark": "22 October 2021"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.59, 0.9, 1.1, 1.18, 1.42, 1.55, 1.93, 2.23, 2.62, 3.37, 3.74]}, {"scene": "reg", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]", "notEstablished[2]"], "text": "But the registry's list dates it March 7, 2023. When it was sent is not known.", "t0": 26.61, "t1": 33.01, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ag", "kicker": "Notice to register", "text": "dated 22 October 2021; the registry's document list dates it 7 March 2023", "mark": "22 October 2021"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.54, 0.71, 1.2, 1.64, 1.93, 2.06, 2.33, 3.26, 3.56, 4.62, 4.81, 4.88, 5.02, 5.69, 5.91, 6.09]}, {"scene": "reg", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "Four days after it registered, a notice listed it as delinquent for 2019, 2020 and 2021.", "t0": 33.13, "t1": 38.84, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "is not in good standing and is prohibited from engaging in conduct for which registration is required, including soliciting or disbursing charitable funds"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.45, 0.69, 0.8, 1.4, 1.55, 1.86, 2.17, 2.31, 2.47, 2.94, 3.09, 3.38, 4.06, 4.36, 4.71, 4.89, 5.18]}, {"scene": "reg", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "A delinquent charity, the notice says, is not in good standing.", "t0": 38.96, "t1": 42.09, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "is not in good standing and is prohibited from engaging in conduct for which registration is required, including soliciting or disbursing charitable funds"}, "emph": ["not in good standing"], "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.54, 1.14, 1.29, 1.53, 2.1, 2.3, 2.47, 2.54, 2.71]}, {"scene": "catch", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "Then reports for four years arrived together, listed on June 16, 2023.", "t0": 42.31, "t1": 46.96, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Renewal reports, all listed 16 June 2023", "rows": [["2019", "$1,200"], ["2020", "$1,200"], ["2021", "$3,500"], ["2022", "$625,025.00"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.56, 0.74, 1.0, 1.23, 1.52, 2.31, 2.64, 2.76, 3.01, 3.77, 4.07]}, {"scene": "catch", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "Revenue of 1,200, 1,200 and 3,500 dollars.", "t0": 47.08, "t1": 50.97, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Renewal reports, all listed 16 June 2023", "rows": [["2019", "$1,200"], ["2020", "$1,200"], ["2021", "$3,500"], ["2022", "$625,025.00"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.37, 0.5, 1.01, 1.54, 1.72, 2.02, 2.15, 2.37, 2.47, 2.67, 2.98, 3.21, 3.44]}, {"scene": "catch", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "Then 625,025 for 2022.", "t0": 51.09, "t1": 54.12, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Renewal reports, all listed 16 June 2023", "rows": [["2019", "$1,200"], ["2020", "$1,200"], ["2021", "$3,500"], ["2022", "$625,025.00"]]}, "emph": ["625,025"], "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.46, 0.7, 1.11, 1.49, 1.94, 2.04, 2.27]}, {"scene": "catch", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[1].what", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "The 2021 report says no government funding. But fiscal 2022 began in July 2021.", "t0": 54.24, "t1": 60.07, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2021 report: governmental funding", "No"], "b": ["City payments, fiscal 2022", "$301,636.78"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.45, 0.9, 1.32, 1.58, 1.81, 2.21, 3.01, 3.21, 3.59, 3.82, 4.36, 4.64, 4.73, 5.08, 5.35]}, {"scene": "catch", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Was any City money paid in 2021? The payment file can't say.", "t0": 60.19, "t1": 63.63, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["2021 report: governmental funding", "No"], "b": ["City payments, fiscal 2022", "$301,636.78"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.33, 0.57, 0.78, 1.03, 1.12, 1.39, 2.15, 2.31, 2.63, 2.9, 3.14]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "timeline[8]"], "text": "For 2023, it sent the State four papers at once, its own books among them.", "t0": 63.85, "t1": 68.37, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "ag", "kicker": "The package for 2023 · stamped 31 May 2024", "text": "four papers: a renewal report, a treasurer's report, a tax return and a printout of the books", "mark": "four papers"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.41, 1.23, 1.39, 1.62, 1.73, 2.06, 2.31, 2.63, 2.76, 3.42, 3.64, 3.85, 4.06, 4.31]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "form", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[5]"], "text": "Revenue comes out three ways. Expenses, two ways. Total assets, three ways.", "t0": 68.49, "t1": 73.07, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "form", "title": "Revenue, 2023", "sub": "one year, three figures", "rows": [["Renewal report", "$1,142,373.25"], ["Return summary page", "$1,114,373.25"], ["Books", "$1,117,271.66"]]}, "emph": ["three ways"], "wt": [0.0, 0.43, 0.64, 0.82, 1.07, 1.97, 2.6, 2.84, 3.14, 3.53, 3.96, 4.22]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[5]"], "text": "Total assets: zero on two forms. On the return, the revenue figure again.", "t0": 73.19, "t1": 77.94, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["Total assets, renewal report", "$0.00"], "b": ["Total assets, the return", "$1,142,373.25"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.34, 1.28, 1.77, 1.93, 2.14, 2.98, 3.13, 3.22, 3.68, 3.83, 4.16, 4.44]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[6]"], "text": "One figure, 886,452.64 dollars,", "t0": 78.06, "t1": 82.85, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "$886,452.64", "kicker": "One figure, three labels", "sub": "Program Expenses, Program Revenue, other expenses"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.72, 0.92, 1.19, 1.66, 2.14, 2.38, 2.63, 3.07, 3.43, 3.58, 4.07]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[6]"], "text": "is program expenses on one form and program revenue on another.", "t0": 82.85, "t1": 86.43, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "magnifier", "label": "$886,452.64", "kicker": "One figure, three labels", "sub": "Program Expenses, Program Revenue, other expenses"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.62, 1.08, 1.23, 1.44, 2.1, 2.34, 2.76, 3.11, 3.23]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[6]"], "text": "It is simply total expenses less payroll. It is not a payment to anyone.", "t0": 86.55, "t1": 90.43, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Everything except payroll", "sub": "the return's total expenses less its salaries line"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.28, 0.66, 1.04, 1.54, 1.74, 2.2, 2.35, 2.48, 2.71, 2.77, 3.12, 3.31]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[6]"], "text": "The return counts 6 employees,", "t0": 90.55, "t1": 92.35, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Everything except payroll", "sub": "the return's total expenses less its salaries line"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.5, 0.79, 1.02]}, {"scene": "four", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].why", "established[6]"], "text": "and the books show 269,330.18 dollars of personnel costs.", "t0": 92.35, "t1": 97.72, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "Everything except payroll", "sub": "the return's total expenses less its salaries line"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.22, 0.32, 0.59, 0.88, 1.1, 1.36, 1.87, 2.31, 2.55, 2.76, 2.99, 3.31, 3.42, 3.79, 4.08, 4.19, 4.64]}, {"scene": "books", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[7]", "story[5]"], "text": "The books name its sources: three Dream Keeper lines, OEWD, and Novation Lab.", "t0": 97.94, "t1": 102.46, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Grants in the 2023 books", "rows": [["HRC DKI", "$379,674.24"], ["OEWD", "$229,673.04"], ["OECE Novation Lab", "$182,805.62"], ["HRC DKI", "$175,000.00"], ["HRC DKI", "$150,000.00"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.42, 0.62, 0.76, 1.64, 1.91, 2.16, 2.42, 2.78, 3.64, 3.79, 4.2]}, {"scene": "books", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "They end 2023 with checking overdrawn by 11,297.84 dollars,", "t0": 102.58, "t1": 108.24, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$11,297.84", "label": "checking account overdrawn, 31 December 2023", "sub": "equity of minus $93,141.37"}, "emph": ["11,297.84"], "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.35, 0.7, 1.34, 1.53, 1.88, 2.32, 2.45, 2.75, 3.09, 3.23, 3.54, 4.04, 4.38, 4.5, 4.92]}, {"scene": "books", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[8]"], "text": "and equity of minus 93,141.37.", "t0": 108.24, "t1": 111.77, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$11,297.84", "label": "checking account overdrawn, 31 December 2023", "sub": "equity of minus $93,141.37"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.25, 0.64, 0.75, 1.04, 1.48, 1.9, 2.05, 2.32, 2.8, 2.99, 3.22]}, {"scene": "books", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["story[6]", "suspicious[4].why"], "text": "That may be because it had no bookkeeper; none of these lines shows misuse.", "t0": 111.89, "t1": 115.98, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "its errors look like poor bookkeeping"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.33, 0.47, 0.86, 0.99, 1.16, 1.29, 2.29, 2.47, 2.56, 2.75, 3.04, 3.31]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[4]"], "text": "Which version did the two paying departments see? And did either check the registry before paying?", "t0": 116.2, "t1": 121.43, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Which version of 2023 the paying departments saw", "Whether either checked the State's registry before paying"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.56, 0.69, 0.78, 0.95, 1.17, 1.58, 2.55, 2.7, 2.87, 3.11, 3.37, 3.48, 3.98, 4.28]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "settle", "ref": ["next[0]", "next[1]"], "text": "Their grant files and invoices would show what was paid, when, and for what.", "t0": 121.43, "t1": 125.35, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "settle", "cards": [{"who": "", "what": "Grant files and invoices at the Human Rights Commission and OEWD"}, {"who": "", "what": "The monitoring forms and financial statements they were given"}], "focus": 0}, "wt": [0.04, 0.26, 0.5, 0.79, 0.9, 1.36, 1.52, 1.72, 1.84, 1.98, 2.79, 3.24, 3.44, 3.61]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "status", "ref": ["status", "established[1]"], "text": "The registry now lists it as registered and current. No authority has made a finding.", "t0": 125.47, "t1": 129.33, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "status"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.52, 0.71, 0.94, 1.04, 1.19, 1.61, 1.73, 2.51, 2.7, 3.1, 3.23, 3.39, 3.46]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["end"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 129.45, "t1": 131.22, "shot": "b20", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.34, 0.44, 0.52, 0.9, 1.06, 1.15]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Paid first", "reg": "The registry", "catch": "Catching up", "four": "One year, four ways", "books": "The books", "close": "Where it stands"}, "look": "terminal", "hook": "document"}